# Existing .pert plans should normally be maintained through perttool commands; direct DSL editing bypasses goal/DAG owner-confirmation checks.
project HIST_RECEIPT_001:
  version 6
  title "Retained assurance receipt historical classification correction"
  description "Correct GitHub Issue #20 as a bounded historical transition patch. Treat a stable retained assurance receipt producer absent from both adjacent snapshots as unchanged while retaining conflicts for one-sided task presence, changed present frozen task plans, changed immutable evidence, noncanonical removal, and invalid canonical advance proof. Preserve Grammar 8, CLI Contract 9, historical result identities, assurance meanings, Git evidence bounds, public facades, commands, schemas, adapters, persistence, and unrelated history classifications. Release selection, publication, remote writes, Issue mutation, plan advance, and unrelated work remain separate."
  as_of 2026-08-21
  duration_unit point
  finish HIST_RECEIPT_ACCEPTED
  goal_owner user
  dag_owner user

